613	        `Refusing to run. An applied migration file must be immutable: the ` +
614	        `database was changed by the OLD contents, so the new contents have ` +
615	        `never run anywhere. Fix by reverting the file, or by writing the ` +
616	        `change as a NEW migration. Only if you are certain the recorded row ` +
617	        `is wrong should you correct ${LEDGER_QUALIFIED} by hand.`,
